      "text": {
        "en": "Aquarium hobbyists consistently praise the team for patient and practical guidance on tank setups, water chemistry, and live coral care. Many note that employees explain product options thoroughly without pushing unnecessary purchases. A single customer found the customer service hurried, but overall feedback highlights friendly and attentive support."
