        "en": "Vibrant and healthy aquatic livestock"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers frequently highlight the condition and diversity of freshwater fish, saltwater specimens, live corals, and aquarium plants. Buyers report active bettas and colorful corals that adapt smoothly to home aquariums. While one visitor observed occasional overcrowding in specific display tanks, most reviewers consider the livestock hardy and well maintained."
      }
