      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors describe a well-arranged store stocked with filtration gear, water treatments, testing supplies, and specialized aquatic foods. Hobbyists appreciate browsing through clearly organized shelves without feeling rushed. Reviewers travel from neighboring Florida cities specifically for the variety of dry goods and live aquarium specimens."
